# Compiled audio-driver helpers — build artifacts regenerated from the
# tracked .c/.cpp/.swift source by scripts/build-audio-native.sh during the
# build (scripts/build.ts → buildAudioNative), then copied to the gitignored
# resources/darwin/. No reason to track the binaries themselves.
